      "title": "File:Bowen Falls Milford Sound NZ. (10657996025).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/21/Bowen_Falls_Milford_Sound_NZ._%2810657996025%29.jpg",
